WEBVTT

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:14,480
Does the safe sleeve work the same way the heatron does for EFF protection?

00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:24,080
No, so the heatron can help the EFFs that are coming off your phone to be less damaging to you.

00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:34,240
The safe sleeve blocks EFFs. So two different things there. So you could use both a heatron. I have a

00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:45,360
heatron on my phone and I use the safe sleeve. And I almost never put my phone up to my ear to talk.

00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:53,200
I use my phone almost always either in the car or the speaker or speaker phone.

00:00:54,960 --> 00:01:03,200
Not put it up to my ear. So you want to keep the EFFs away from you as much as possible.

00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:12,320
The safe sleeve blocks the EFFs. So with the safe sleeve you can close the front face of it

00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:18,000
and still talk on the phone up to your ear. It's going to block a good degree of EFFs.

00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:26,640
And then if you want to completely block the EFFs from your phone, you could put it in what's

00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:36,080
called a Faraday Cage. Faraday Cage is a term that it means that you're putting it in some

00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:45,040
type of sleeve or compartment that blocks all EFFs, blocks all frequencies.

00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:50,960
You will be able to receive phone calls or text notes in that. So we have those

00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:57,200
they're super cheap. I think they're $15. There's fabric, double fabric,

00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:02,960
sleeves that are a little bit bigger than your phone, that you can slip your phone into

00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:08,320
and you're basically putting your phone to sleep. So you're not going to be able to receive phone calls

00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:13,360
and you're not going to be able to receive text, but you will deduct it at EFFs from it.

00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:20,160
So there's benefits to doing that at different times, like when you can still put the charging

00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:25,920
port outside the phone, you don't have to close up the sleeve and you can charge your phone at night

00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:31,360
without getting any EFFs, but it's better to keep it away from it.

